  "description": "## What's New in v6.2.0\n\n\t\t### Round-Level Token Usage\n\t\t- Added StreamingContentType.RoundUsage events for per-LLM-round token usage during streaming.\n\t\t- RoundUsage.Usage reports only the current LLM round, while Completion.Usage remains cumulative for the whole streaming run.\n\t\t- Added StreamingContent.RoundIndex and StreamingContent.IsFinalRound through Mythosia.AI.Abstractions v2.1.0.\n\t\t- Gemini streaming now drains after function-call chunks so late usage metadata can be captured before the next round.\n\n\t\tRequires Mythosia.AI.Abstractions v2.1.0.\n\n\t\t---\n\n\t\t## Documentation\n\t\t- Basic Usage: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki\n\t\t- Advanced Features: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki/Advanced-Features\n\t\t- Release Notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/wiki/Release-Notes\n\t\t- GitHub: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI",
